  "_comment_CloakTiers": "Cloak prefab name -> tier (1 to 6). Tier sets which treatments a cloak takes: 1 Simple, 2 Weathered, 4 Hardened, 5 Storm-worn, 6 Odin's Gift. Any Shoulder item not listed uses Default.",
